{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_11_level_main_11-17_end",
  "groupId": "main_11",
  "stageId": "main_11-17",
  "title": "直指命運",
  "storyCode": "11-19",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-17_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0200b598171aec17db632dd9ceab8940a574c4833ea1c193607bab599d97a28b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "噴氣聲。\n沉悶的噴氣聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾個模糊的音節。是誰在呼喚他的姓名嗎？\n可他已經不記得自己到底叫什麼了。\n“埃文斯”“瓊斯”“威爾遜”，還是“林奇”？\n他誰都不是，又彷彿誰都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可是為什麼......\n為什麼在砍向他們的異族的刀劍之後，藏匿著同胞的身影？\n戰友們逐一倒下。\n最後只剩下他一個。他是......最後的蒸汽騎士。\n他不能再倒下。他倒下了，蒸汽騎士就倒下了。\n維多利亞仍需要他，他必須履行自己的職責。\n沒有醫藥，沒關係，盔甲會填補他的血肉。\n沒有食物，沒關係，黑暗之中總有一些窸窸窣窣的小動物爬過。\n沒有照明，沒關係，那把劍能帶給他唯一的光輝。\n他還沒有死。蒸汽騎士沒有死。他們依然在守護維多利亞。\n然而......\n什麼是維多利亞？\n我向國王宣誓，向人民許諾，向大地致敬。\n我堅守過無數漫長黑夜，卻不知該往何處尋找一生效忠的屬於維多利亞的光明。\n維多利亞是國王嗎？\n國王被吊死了。\n維多利亞是議會與貴族們嗎？\n沒有維護，沒有補給，沒有新加入的成員，他們一次次將蒸汽騎士派去必死的險境，為他們的貪婪摘取果實。\n維多利亞是民眾嗎？\n民眾傳頌著蒸汽騎士，崇拜著蒸汽騎士，卻也將自己所有的渴求寄託在了蒸汽騎士之上。沒有什麼能承載如此矛盾，如此龐雜的希望。\n維多利亞是什麼？\n維多利亞是不是只是一種想像？\n好在，還有這把劍，諸王之息。\n無可辯駁，它就是維多利亞的象徵。\n好吧，蒸汽騎士認定，那麼現在，它就是自己的維多利亞。\n現在，有人想要玷污他的維多利亞。\n他無法容忍。\n他不能失去自己最後的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“最後的蒸汽騎士”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_651_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（沉悶的噴氣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“最後的蒸汽騎士”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_651_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“維多利亞。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......你還聽得到嗎，騎士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我無權命令你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我懇請你，懇請你讓我們帶走這把劍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這與我的身份無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倫蒂尼姆需要它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#7$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不是倫蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蜷縮在孤兒院的孩子需要它，被戰爭盤剝的農戶需要它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "用自己的血汗充作車床潤滑劑的工人需要它，在酒館裡買醉來逃避絕望的市民需要它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了自己的家園挺身而出的自救軍戰士需要它，想要消弭一場毀滅性災難的羅德島需要它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它能驅散的不是風暴，是恐懼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它必須被如此使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#3$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "騎士，它不是你的維多利亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#3$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請讓我通過這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不是維多利亞？\n那麼，維多利亞在哪裡？\n蒸汽騎士的胸腔裡充滿了困惑與憤怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那麼，維多利亞在哪裡？！\n那麼，他為之效忠的維多利亞是什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“最後的蒸汽騎士”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_651_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（沉悶的噴氣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_396_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他、他的動作變快了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_396_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們抵擋不住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#3$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿勒黛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......亞歷山德莉娜殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還記得那天，我們第一次相見的那天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們本該多聊聊的，你帶著那把劍，出現在了公爵府中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是一個......非常美麗的午後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "音樂縈繞在庭院，鮮花毫無顧忌地綻放，人們一邊跳舞一邊談論明天，一切都飽含著希望......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那時，我還能毫無顧忌地誇口，自己一定能成為蒸汽騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而光輝......灑在劍身上......也灑在你的身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們都說......那個下午是一個奇跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她在奔跑。\n剛剛修剪過的草坪踩上去又刺又癢。園丁吉姆樂呵呵地站在灌木叢邊上傻笑。艾爾希在背後追著她，提醒她慢一些慢一些。\n可她急著奔向那些新開的花。那可是金色的，在陽光下閃閃發光，就和坎伯蘭的家徽一樣。\n爸爸將她一把抱了起來，讓她坐在他的肩膀上。他托起她小小的手掌，讓她觸摸蒸汽甲胄上的紋樣。\n殘破的甲胄突然站了起來。\n爸爸消失了，她長高了，也不再站在盔甲面前。她感到盔甲的重量沉甸甸地壓在自己肩上。\n透過頭盔，她看到道路的盡頭走出來了一隻金燦燦的獅子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼多年過去，我很難再相信奇跡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "艾爾希曾告訴我，就連我也不知道將來的自己在哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很對不起她，恐怕沒有什麼將來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是我幾歲的時候？記不清了，我向艾爾希保證，我會成為蒸汽騎士，保護所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少現在，我還有面對一位蒸汽騎士的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽你的，維娜，沒有什麼使命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有坎伯蘭的，也沒有大公爵的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去*維多利亞粗口*的使命，我已經足夠累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無論是扮演一個貴族，扮演一個領袖，還是扮演一個朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自救軍的戰士信任你，你便是他們的領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我稱你為朋友，你便是我的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，維娜，已經足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我們把那個寓言結束吧，總得畫下句號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "達格達，告訴摩根，讓她在她的回憶錄裡把我寫得好一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "起碼，用些典雅的詞語吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這風......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "狂風驟起，將她們捲向門外。\n推進之王看到一張威嚴的面孔砸在腳邊。然後是下一張。四周的諸王石像正在逐一倒塌。\n碎石們擋在她的面前，也擋住了不遠處的蒸汽騎士......和另一個人。\n推進之王立刻反應了過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#3$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿勒黛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原諒我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她的嘴唇動了動。\n推進之王知道阿勒黛在呼喚她。\n維娜......還是殿下？\n推進之王不知道。\n也許永遠都不會知道了。\n那最後一個音節徹底淹沒在了碎石堆中。\n大門轟然關閉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我面對你吧，我的夢魘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_397_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“最後的蒸汽騎士”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_651_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（沉悶的噴氣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蒸汽騎士混沌的記憶中，突然闖進了一個畫面。\n在他站起身來之前，一個女孩在為他落淚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這傢伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_405_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們沒地方後退了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鉛踝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4062_totter_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最後一枚煙霧彈了，我們還有機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_405_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你做得夠多了，雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_405_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要是投降，他們說不定會饒你一命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鉛踝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4062_totter_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可不行，那又得工作多少年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "趕快把這裡結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......就是你們嗎？在阿勒黛身後的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不是你們，懦弱的公爵可不敢親自在這裡露面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿勒黛失敗了，亞歷山德莉娜獲得了諸王之息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這件事終究還是無聊了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧，你們也行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們必須——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#3$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "償還你們所做的一切！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴君",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "站住，叛徒，站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有什麼能阻擋我的腳步。你必須償還你犯下的所有惡行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴君",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你也會同我一起死去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我並不懼怕肉體的消亡，因為我的身後還有無數雙眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "勇敢的孩子們，你們將成為我的後繼者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們將記住我的一切美德，並代替我將眼前這得來不易的和平帶至明天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太棒了，戈爾丁女士，演出非常成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是大家辛苦一年多的成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是城內的局勢不那麼緊張，海蒂也能看到就好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是因為這麼緊張，這齣戲才格外有意義嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您看，孩子們多高興——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，里奧，別穿著道具到處跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天真的孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，逃吧，逃吧，我會追著你，偉大的維多利亞會追著你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "踏過山谷，踏過河流，轟隆隆，轟隆隆......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "碾碎它們！把血液從它們身體裡擠出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該死，你們全都該死！我會追上你，殺死你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天真的孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "擠出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "投降吧，薩卡茲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天真的孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "投降吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的孩子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_240",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不投降也沒關係，因為我會追上你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快停下，戈爾丁女士親手做的“蒸汽甲胄”都快被你弄壞了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "戈爾丁女士，別生氣。他們只是在做遊戲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "遊戲......嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，女士，我們的舞台劇已經演完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......“把血液從它們身體裡擠出來”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是......薩卡茲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "填滿了書店的血紅色再度浮上眼前。\n這一次，她甚至沒有力氣乾嘔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這很正常，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟......我們正處在一場戰爭中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城裡的薩卡茲最近總在到處抓人，手段還很殘暴。孩子們可能看見了，就下意識地模仿了薩卡茲的行為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "茉莉，你知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "許多高盧遺民......都對蒸汽騎士心懷恐懼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "經歷過那場戰爭的人，永遠都不會忘掉那一夜突然出現在窗外的噴氣聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是......我期盼著蒸汽騎士對孩子們而言，可以不僅是一件用以奪走他人性命的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我期盼著他們扮演蒸汽騎士這個角色的時候，能在他身上寄託一些美好的希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我曾以為這種對抗能贏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "戈爾丁望著孩子們追逐打鬧的身影。\n泡沫製作而成的蒸汽騎士的甲胄掉落到了地上。她想要把它撿起來，伸出去的手卻彷彿被燙了一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我總以為自己在教導孩子們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到這一刻，我才發覺是孩子們教會了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是......孩子們的演出的結尾。一個真正的結尾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在如此巨大的時代面前，我們能做的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們所做的，或許毫無意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "書本中的教育遙遠且模糊，而時代——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有人能擺脫它的形塑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若時代屬於鮮血、暴力與戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們......我們的孩子們，誰也無法倖免。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們便屬於鮮血、暴力與戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我該怎麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈爾丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我怎麼可能妄圖對抗它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
